path: workspaces/storage/decisions/00-decision-packet.md
expect: recommendation-quality/packet-row-indeterminate
family: ABSENT cell — the state distinction, and it must NOT report as EMPTY
note: THE LOAD-BEARING STATE CASE. Row Q2 has NO cell at the recommendation index at
  all — the row is ragged, not blank. Expect `packet-row-indeterminate` and expect
  `packet-answer-empty` to be ABSENT from the verdict: a malformed row and an
  unanswered one are different facts, and reporting the first as the second is the
  non-discriminating instrument this detector exists to avoid. The finding also
  carries `advisory`, not `halt-and-report`, for the same reason.
